{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Read-only, aggregate operational state for Honcho workspaces. No message, document, peer, session, or queue payload content is exported.",
  "editable": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Honcho operational state\n\nAll data is collected by a dedicated, read-only PostgreSQL role through aggregate-only queries. Choose one **Workspace** at a time. Document and queue panels then repeat into one chart per document level or queue task type, respectively; their legends show only the deletion/state dimension. **Exporter health** confirms current database access; queue and embedding series show workflow backlog/state, not individual customer or agent activity."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Exporter / database health",
      "description": "1 means the latest aggregate-only PostgreSQL snapshot succeeded; 0 means it failed. This is access/collection health, not the state of a specific queue task.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "honcho_exporter_up{job=\"honcho\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{workspace}}"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Scrape duration",
      "description": "Wall-clock duration of the latest exporter aggregate snapshot. Sustained increases can indicate database load or an inefficient query plan.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "honcho_exporter_scrape_duration_seconds{job=\"honcho\"}",
          "legendFormat": "snapshot"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Sessions and peers",
      "description": "Current aggregate peer count and active/inactive session counts. These are counts only; no names or identifiers are exported.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "honcho_workspace_peers{job=\"honcho\", workspace=~\"$workspace\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{workspace}} peers"
        },
        {
          "expr": "honcho_workspace_sessions{job=\"honcho\", workspace=~\"$workspace\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{workspace}} {{state}} sessions"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Messages and tokens",
      "description": "Stored aggregate message count and aggregate token count. These are retained database totals rather than the current context window or traffic rate.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "honcho_workspace_messages{job=\"honcho\", workspace=~\"$workspace\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{workspace}} messages"
        },
        {
          "expr": "honcho_workspace_message_tokens{job=\"honcho\", workspace=~\"$workspace\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{workspace}} tokens"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "$workspace $document_level documents by deletion state",
      "description": "One chart per selected workspace and document level. The two series are stored documents with deleted=false and deleted=true. It does not export document contents, source IDs, or peer identities.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "honcho_workspace_documents{job=\"honcho\", workspace=\"$workspace\", level=\"$document_level\"}",
          "legendFormat": "deleted={{deleted}}"
        }
      ],
      "repeat": "document_level",
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "maxPerRow": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Embedding synchronization state",
      "description": "Aggregate document and message embedding rows grouped by bounded sync state. A persistent pending or failed population indicates reconciliation work to investigate.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "honcho_workspace_document_embeddings{job=\"honcho\", workspace=~\"$workspace\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{workspace}} document {{sync_state}}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "honcho_workspace_message_embeddings{job=\"honcho\", workspace=~\"$workspace\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{workspace}} message {{sync_state}}"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "$workspace $queue_task_type queue items by state",
      "description": "One chart per selected workspace and queue task type. The series are pending, in_progress, and completed counts. In-progress is derived from the active queue-session table; pending age is shown separately.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "honcho_workspace_queue_items{job=\"honcho\", workspace=\"$workspace\", task_type=\"$queue_task_type\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21
      },
      "repeat": "queue_task_type",
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "maxPerRow": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Oldest pending work age",
      "description": "Age of the oldest queue item that is pending (unprocessed and not active), grouped by bounded task type. A high value is backlog age, not runtime duration of an active task.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "honcho_workspace_oldest_pending_age_seconds{job=\"honcho\", workspace=~\"$workspace\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{workspace}} {{task_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Active queue sessions",
      "description": "Distinct active queue work-unit count. It should be interpreted with queue state counts; it does not expose any work-unit identifiers.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "honcho_workspace_active_queue_sessions{job=\"honcho\", workspace=~\"$workspace\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{workspace}}"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 29
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Native deriver queue throughput",
      "description": "Rate of queue items completed by the native Honcho deriver process. This is a throughput counter from the loopback-only native metrics endpoint, distinct from the exporter\u2019s point-in-time queue inventory.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(deriver_queue_items_processed_total{job=\"honcho_deriver\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "queue items/s"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Native deriver generated-token throughput",
      "description": "Generated output tokens per second, grouped by deriver task type. This uses only component=output_total and token_type=output. Unlike the input accounting components, these series can be read as output-token throughput and are not an overlapping breakdown.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (task_type) (rate(deriver_tokens_processed_total{job=\"honcho_deriver\", token_type=\"output\", component=\"output_total\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{task_type}} output tokens/s"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 37
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Native deriver input-token accounting components (not additive)",
      "description": "Input-token rates as reported by the native deriver. prompt, messages, and previous_summary are overlapping accounting components for the same work, so do NOT sum them into a total. This panel exposes the breakdown rather than hiding it.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(deriver_tokens_processed_total{job=\"honcho_deriver\", token_type=\"input\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{task_type}} input / {{component}} tokens/s"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 45
      }
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "tags": [
    "honcho",
    "postgresql",
    "operational"
  ],
